<!--meta {"lead": "A list stacks short, similar items in one column: notifications, a braider's services, a help topic's articles. Each row is one line or two, with an optional avatar or icon.", "description": "Simple, two-line, avatar, interactive and unread list rows with dividers, in both themes.", "pills": ["<code>&lt;ul&gt;</code> / <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code>", "Status: stable"], "variants": "simple, two-line, with avatar or icon, interactive (link rows), unread, with dividers", "states": "default, hover, focus, current/selected, unread", "sources": []} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
  <p>Use a list for a run of homogeneous items that people scan top to bottom and open one at a time. Use <a href="card.html">cards</a> when each item carries media or several actions, a <a href="table.html">table</a> when people compare fields across items, and a plain <code>&lt;ul&gt;</code> or <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code> in prose (the "Prepare for your visit" steps).</p>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Simple</b>: one line per row.</li>
    <li><b>Two-line</b>: a title and a meta line in <code>--color-fg-muted</code>.</li>
    <li><b>With avatar or icon</b>: a leading 40px avatar or 20px icon.</li>
    <li><b>Interactive</b>: each row is a link (<code>&lt;a class="list__item list__item--interactive"&gt;</code>), 44px tall at minimum.</li>
    <li><b>Unread</b>: an accent dot before the title plus the word "Unread" for screen readers.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="anatomy"><h2><a href="#anatomy">Anatomy</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-anatomy">
    <figure class="ds-anatomy__figure">
      <ul class="list card card--flush" style="width: 100%;"><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive" href="../../mocks/pages/appointment-detail/default.html"><span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">NO</span><div class="list__body"><div class="list__title">Nia received your request</div><div class="list__meta">Today at 9:42 am · HP-1048</div></div>{{icon:chevron-right}}</a></li></ul>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 6%; top: 30%;" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 30%; top: 30%;" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 30%; top: 70%;" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 92%; top: 30%;" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
    </figure>
    <ol class="ds-anatomy__list">
      <li><div><b>Leading avatar or icon (optional)</b><small>Decorative when the title already names the person.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Title</b><small><code>.list__title</code>: label type at 16px.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Meta (optional)</b><small><code>.list__meta</code>: body-sm in <code>--color-fg-muted</code>; time first.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Trailing chevron or badge (optional)</b><small>Chevron for navigation rows; a badge for status.</small></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="variants"><h2><a href="#variants">Variants</a></h2>
  {{example:[stack]Simple, two-line with avatar, and an interactive notifications list with an unread row.}}
<ul class="list card card--flush">
  <li class="list__item">Medium knotless braids · from $180</li>
  <li class="list__item">Passion twists · from $160</li>
  <li class="list__item">Cornrows · from $90</li>
</ul>
<ul class="list card card--flush">
  <li class="list__item"><span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">NO</span><div class="list__body"><div class="list__title">Nia Okafor</div><div class="list__meta">Toronto West · 4.9 ★ from 86 reviews</div></div></li>
  <li class="list__item"><span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><div class="list__body"><div class="list__title">Aisha Mensah</div><div class="list__meta">North York · 4.8 ★ from 64 reviews</div></div></li>
</ul>
<ul class="list card card--flush" aria-label="Notifications">
  <li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive list__item--unread" href="../../mocks/pages/appointment-detail/default.html"><div class="list__body"><div class="list__title"><span class="visually-hidden">Unread: </span>Nia received your request</div><div class="list__meta">Today at 9:42 am · She will confirm the time and final price.</div></div><span class="badge badge--warning">Unread</span></a></li>
  <li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive" href="../../mocks/pages/care-and-review/default.html"><div class="list__body"><div class="list__title">How to prepare for knotless braids</div><div class="list__meta">Yesterday · Read Nia’s preparation checklist.</div></div>{{icon:chevron-right}}</a></li>
</ul>
