</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sizes" data-na="One row density; rows grow with a second line. Use a dense table for compact data."><h2><a href="#sizes">Sizes</a></h2></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="states"><h2><a href="#states">States</a></h2>
  <p>Only interactive rows have states. Hover tints the row; focus draws the shared ring inside the row; the current item uses <code>aria-current="true"</code> and the accent tint; unread rows add a dot and a hidden "Unread:" prefix.</p>
  <div class="ds-matrix"><table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Variant</th><th scope="col">Default</th><th scope="col">Hover</th><th scope="col">Focus</th><th scope="col">Current</th><th scope="col">Unread</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th scope="row">Interactive</th>
        <td><ul class="list card card--flush"><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive" href="../../mocks/pages/help/default.html"><div class="list__title">How requests work</div></a></li></ul></td>
        <td><ul class="list card card--flush"><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive" data-state="hover" href="../../mocks/pages/help/default.html"><div class="list__title">How requests work</div></a></li></ul></td>
        <td><ul class="list card card--flush"><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive" data-state="focus" href="../../mocks/pages/help/default.html"><div class="list__title">How requests work</div></a></li></ul></td>
        <td><ul class="list card card--flush"><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive" aria-current="true" href="../../mocks/pages/help/default.html"><div class="list__title">How requests work</div></a></li></ul></td>
        <td><ul class="list card card--flush"><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive list__item--unread" href="../../mocks/pages/notification-center/unread.html"><div class="list__title">Time confirmed</div><span class="badge badge--warning">Unread</span></a></li></ul></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h3>Both themes</h3>
  {{themes:stack}}<ul class="list card card--flush"><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive list__item--unread" href="../../mocks/pages/notification-center/unread.html"><div class="list__body"><div class="list__title"><span class="visually-hidden">Unread: </span>Nia received your request</div><div class="list__meta">Today at 9:42 am</div></div></a></li><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive" data-state="hover" href="../../mocks/pages/care-and-review/default.html"><div class="list__body"><div class="list__title">How to prepare</div><div class="list__meta">Yesterday</div></div></a></li></ul>{{/themes}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="responsive"><h2><a href="#responsive">Responsive behaviour</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Lists are one column at every width; on wide screens cap them with the detail grid's main column or <code>--layout-form-max</code> rather than stretching rows to 1280px.</li>
    <li>Titles wrap; meta lines may use <code>.truncate</code> on phones when the full text is available on the next screen.</li>
    <li>Trailing badges stay on the title row and never push the title below 50% of the row.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="theming"><h2><a href="#theming">Theming</a></h2>
  <p>Rows read <code>--color-border-default</code> (dividers), <code>--color-bg-subtle</code> (hover), <code>--color-accent-subtle</code> (current) and <code>--color-accent</code> (unread dot). Place the list in a <code>.card.card--flush</code> for the surface and edge.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="accessibility"><h2><a href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
  <h3>Role and pattern</h3>
  <p>A native <code>&lt;ul&gt;</code> (or <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code> when order matters) so the item count is announced. Interactive rows are <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> inside <code>&lt;li&gt;</code>; never <code>role="listbox"</code> unless the list is a selection widget.</p>
  <h3>Keyboard</h3>
  <table class="ds-table ds-keys"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><kbd>Tab</kbd> / <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd></td><td>Moves between row links.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><kbd>Enter</kbd></td><td>Opens the focused row.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
  <h3>Focus</h3>
  <p>The shared ring on the row link. Each row is one tab stop; do not nest a second link inside an interactive row.</p>
  <h3>Labelling</h3>
  <p>Give a list a name when several sit on a page (<code>aria-label="Notifications"</code>). Unread state is in text ("Unread:" visually hidden, or a visible badge), not only the dot. Leading avatars repeat the title's name and are <code>aria-hidden</code>.</p>
  <h3>Contrast</h3>
  <div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack" style="padding: 0; gap: var(--space-2);">
    {{pair:Title on row|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}
    {{pair:Meta on row|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}
    {{pair:Title on hovered row|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-subtle|4.5}}
    {{pair:Title on current row|--color-fg-default|--color-accent-subtle|4.5}}
    {{pair:Unread dot on row|--color-accent|--color-bg-surface|3}}
  </div>
  <h3>Motion</h3>
  <p>Hover tint transitions over <code>--duration-fast</code>; reduced motion makes it instant.</p>
  <h3>Touch</h3>
  <p>Interactive rows are at least <code>--target-comfortable</code> (44px) tall and span the full width.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="content"><h2><a href="#content">Content</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Titles say what happened or what the item is ("Nia received your request").</li>
    <li>Meta starts with time ("Today at 9:42 am", "Yesterday"), then one clause of detail.</li>
    <li>Sentence case, no trailing full stop on titles.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="do-dont"><h2><a href="#do-dont">Do and don't</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-dodont">
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack"><ul class="list card card--flush"><li><a class="list__item list__item--interactive" href="../../mocks/pages/appointment-detail/default.html"><div class="list__body"><div class="list__title">Nia received your request</div><div class="list__meta">Today at 9:42 am</div></div></a></li></ul></div><figcaption>Make the whole row one link to the update.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack"><div class="card"><span class="badge badge--warning">Unread</span><p><b>Nia received your request</b></p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="../../mocks/pages/appointment-detail/default.html">View request</a></div></div><figcaption>Give every notification its own card and primary button, as the notification-center mock does; several primaries compete on one page.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><span class="badge badge--warning">Unread</span></div><figcaption>Say "Unread" in text alongside the dot.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><span class="badge badge--info">Read</span></div><figcaption>Badge every row "Read"; mark the exception (unread), not the norm.</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="tokens"><h2><a href="#tokens">Tokens</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-table-wrap"><table class="ds-table">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Token</th><th scope="col">Light</th><th scope="col">Dark</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {{tok:Title|--color-fg-default}}
      {{tok:Meta|--color-fg-muted}}
      {{tok:Divider|--color-border-default}}
      {{tok:Hover|--color-bg-subtle}}
      {{tok:Current|--color-accent-subtle}}
      {{tok:Unread dot|--color-accent}}
      {{tok:Row padding|--space-3|--space-4}}
      {{tok:Gap|--space-3}}
      {{tok:Row min height (interactive)|--target-comfortable}}
      {{tok:Title / meta font|--text-label|--text-body-sm}}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="code"><h2><a href="#code">Code</a></h2>
  <pre><code>&lt;ul class="list card card--flush" aria-label="Notifications"&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="list__item list__item--interactive list__item--unread" href="/appointments/hp-1048"&gt;
    &lt;div class="list__body"&gt;
      &lt;div class="list__title"&gt;&lt;span class="visually-hidden"&gt;Unread: &lt;/span&gt;Nia received your request&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class="list__meta"&gt;Today at 9:42 am&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</code></pre>
  <table class="ds-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Class / attribute</th><th scope="col">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><code>.list</code></td><td>Unstyled vertical list.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.list__item</code></td><td>Row with padding and a bottom divider.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.list__item--interactive</code></td><td>Link row: 44px minimum, hover tint.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.list__item--unread</code></td><td>Accent dot before the title.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.list__body</code> <code>.list__title</code> <code>.list__meta</code></td><td>Text parts.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>aria-current="true"</code></td><td>Current item tint.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.truncate</code></td><td>Single-line ellipsis for meta.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sources"><h2><a href="#sources">Sources</a></h2>
  <p>Core-set component: the mocks show list-shaped content as stacks of cards:</p>
  <ul>
    {{mock:pages/notification-center/default|notifications as cards, each with a primary button}}
    {{mock:pages/notification-center/unread|unread badge on every unread card}}
    {{mock:pages/appointment-detail/default|"Prepare for your visit" ordered list in prose}}
  </ul>
  <p>Drift recorded: notifications were cards with one primary button each and a "Read" badge on read items (system recommends an interactive list with an unread marker only on unread rows); the ordered list in the preparation card had no inline padding and its numbers hung outside the card padding.</p>
</section>
